    "catalogue_description": "Presenting the 2 nd map to have the new Realism Mod 3.0 on it. StevieWonder87 provided the map & BluntStuffy supplied the Mod and the objectives. Come enjoy Industrial Estate like never before with all of the benefits of the Realism Mod 3.0 including a new enemy boss, but be warned before taking him on you better be ready with your best guns, perks, attachments and a turret and Nano Shield couldn\u2019t hurt either\u2026also might be a good idea to update your last will and testament because you just might die a horrible death : ) Features: -The Realism Mod 3.0 and all of its amazing features like character classes, leveling up, a prestige system, gun attachments, supply drops, zombie types, Juggernauts and the Panzer Soldat from BO3. -ED209, a brand new totally awesome, totally brutal custom boss. -A fun objective that unlocks a brand new weapon. ~Tomikaze",
